=AI Model Evaluation=

Judicial AI should be evaluated against the actual tasks for which it
will be used.

== Evaluation Dimensions ==

* accuracy;
* citation integrity;
* reliability;
* limitations;
* robustness;
* security;
* user performance;
* legal-context performance.

== Indonesian Context ==

Evaluation should include realistic Indonesian legal and
administrative scenarios.

== Principle ==

'''Generic benchmark ≠ judicial evidence.'''

[[Category:AI Evaluation]]
[[Category:Judicial AI]]

{{Knowledge
|id=AI-RED-TEAM-TESTING
|type=Security and Assurance
|domain=Judicial AI
|jurisdiction=Indonesia
|source=Indonesia Judiciary Future Blueprint 2035–2045
|evidence=E2 — Strategic Research Draft
|ai_readiness=4
|status=PROPOSED
