=AI Transparency Standard=

Judicial AI use should be sufficiently transparent to permit meaningful
institutional accountability.

== Transparency Areas ==

* system purpose;
* responsible institution;
* risk classification;
* human oversight;
* approved use;
* limitations;
* evaluation;
* incident history where appropriate.

== Principle ==

Transparency should support accountability without exposing protected
information or creating security vulnerabilities.

[[Category:AI Transparency]]
[[Category:AI Governance]]

