=AI Use-Case Registry=

The AI Use-Case Registry records specific judicial tasks for which AI
is proposed, piloted or approved.

== Use-Case Fields ==

* task;
* user;
* expected benefit;
* risk;
* prohibited uses;
* data;
* model;
* human decision point;
* evaluation;
* approval;
* status.

== Purpose ==

The Registry separates the question '''Can AI perform this task?''' from
'''Should AI be permitted to perform this task?'''

[[Category:AI Registry]]
[[Category:Judicial AI]]

