=Judicial AI Governance Framework=

The Judicial AI Governance Framework establishes the institutional
controls required for responsible use of artificial intelligence
throughout the judicial lifecycle.

== Governance Scope ==

* purpose and legality;
* fundamental rights;
* data governance;
* security;
* risk management;
* human oversight;
* transparency;
* auditability;
* procurement;
* accountability.

== Lifecycle ==

'''Design → Assess → Procure → Test → Deploy → Monitor → Audit →
Review → Retire'''

== Core Rule ==

'''AI recommends. Human verifies. Judge decides.'''

[[Category:Judicial AI]]
[[Category:AI Governance]]

