=Judicial AI Procurement Standard=

AI procurement should begin with the judicial problem rather than a
vendor product.

== Required Assessment ==

* problem;
* risk;
* expected outcome;
* data handling;
* security;
* performance evidence;
* limitations;
* human oversight;
* incident procedures;
* interoperability;
* migration;
* termination.

== Evaluation ==

Vendor claims should be tested using realistic Indonesian legal and
administrative scenarios.

Generic benchmark performance alone is insufficient evidence for
judicial deployment.

[[Category:AI Procurement]]
[[Category:AI Governance]]

